``````Stage 1 - Initial Access (SSH brute force) - MITRE ATT&CK T1110```
`````Flags any source IP with 5+ failed SSH logins inside a 2-minute window```
index=main sourcetype=auth-* "Failed password"
| rex field=_raw "Failed password for (invalid user )?(?<user>\S+) from (?<src_ip>\S+)"
| bin _time span=2m
| stats count as attempts by src_ip, user, _time
| where attempts >= 5
| eval attack_stage="1_initial_access", mitre_technique="T1110", severity="medium"
| table _time src_ip user attempts attack_stage mitre_technique severity
`````
